--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ default member initializer: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ member default constructor: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ virtual table of the derived class: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ default argument of the base: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.5\] line \d+ hidden by a constructor of the class: SUCCESS$
